      "content": "i hear u but its not just a feeling. it's like... i look at how much i've been through and how i react to everything, and i just don't see a person there anymore. just a bunch of jagged edges. i feel like i've reached the limit of what a human is supposed to endure. like, is it even realistic to keep saying \"it gets better\" when some things are just fundamentally ruined?",
